  "body": "## T\u00f3m t\u1eaft\nPR n\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 s\u1eeda t\u1ec7p trong `ops/land/` (`pr1267-wp1252-*` v\u00e0 `pr1277-wp1272-*`). Hai h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 land \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e2ng t\u1eeb `landed: false` l\u00ean `landed: true`. C\u0103n c\u1ee9 l\u00e0 c\u00e1c comment ch\u1ee7 kho **t\u1ef1 \u0111\u0103ng**: `performed_via_github_app` l\u00e0 null, `author_association` l\u00e0 OWNER. B\u1ea3n readback REST c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng comment n\u1eb1m trong provenance.\n\n| Packet | authorization_url | Mi\u1ec5n tr\u1eeb / quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh |\n|---|---|---|\n| #1272 | [#1277 issuecomment-6720439348](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1277#issuecomment-6720439348): `approve_merge: fc6fbc7\u2026` | \u2014 |\n| #1252 | [#1267 issuecomment-6720621366](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1267#issuecomment-6720621366): `approve_merge: e6c6505\u2026` | [6720449021](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1267#issuecomment-6720449021): `mien_A14` v\u00e0 `chap_nhan_10_2_4` cho l\u01b0\u1ee3t `launcher-windows` \u0111\u1ecf tr\u00ean `27fd808` (\u0111\u00e3 kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c \u1edf `c15603d`) |\n\n**\u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi l\u1ea1i sau khi merge.** #1252 merge l\u00fac 2026-11-07T09:43:59Z, #1272 merge l\u00fac 2026-11-08T02:38:37Z. Vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ee7 kho \u0111\u00e3 duy\u1ec7t SHA tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi merge (qua phi\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i #1206) m\u1edbi ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 l\u1eddi khai c\u00f3 neo. H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 ghi r\u00f5 \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y.\n\nComment `approve_merge` m\u00e0 agent \u0111\u0103ng qua app claude (6720413056, 6720413655) **kh\u00f4ng** \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng l\u00e0m \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n.\n\n## Ki\u1ec3m\n| C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 | K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 |\n|---|---|\n| `kiem-dong-wp` | C\u1ea3 hai rc 0: \"\u0110\u00d3NG \u0110\u01af\u1ee2C WP\" |\n| `kiem_ho_so_land` | 56/56, DAT cho pr1267 v\u00e0 pr1277 |\n| `land_evidence_nguon` (to\u00e0n kho) | 105 \u0110\u1ea0T |\n| `doctrine-scan` | rc 0 |\n| `git diff --check` | rc 0 |\n| `sha256sum -c` | OK |\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxraXfMD1t2FJLzzGDr4)_",
